#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:4
msgid "Drawy"
msgstr "Drawy"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:5
msgid "Your handy, infinite brainstorming tool"
msgstr "Vaš praktični alat za neograničeno stvaranje ideja"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:13
msgid "Drawy lets you create ideas, diagrams, and visual notes on an infinite whiteboard with a smooth and responsive canvas. You can draw with pressure-sensitive tablet support, add text, insert images, and use basic shapes such as rectangles, ellipses, arrows, and lines to organise your content clearly. You can choose your own color palette and export your work as image files whenever needed. Drawy is built to stay lightweight and fast, making it easy to capture ideas and work freely without distractions."
msgstr "Drawy vam omogućuje stvaranje ideja, dijagrama i vizualnih bilježaka na neograničenoj bijeloj ploči s glatkom i responzivnom površinom za crtanje. Možete crtati uz podršku za tablet osjetljiv na pritisak, dodavati tekst i slike te koristiti osnovne oblike poput pravokutnika, elipsa, strelica i crta kako biste jasno organizirali sadržaj. Možete odabrati vlastitu paletu boja i izvesti svoj rad kao slikovne datoteke kad god zatreba. Drawy je osmišljen kao lagana i brza aplikacija koja olakšava bilježenje ideja i slobodan rad bez ometanja."

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:55
msgid "Create diagrams, notes, and ideas on an infinite whiteboard."
msgstr "Stvarajte dijagrame, bilješke i ideje na neograničenoj bijeloj ploči."

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:59
msgid "Adjust colors, stroke styles, and tools with ease."
msgstr "Jednostavno prilagodite boje, stilove poteza i alate."

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:63
msgid "Stay focused with a dark mode workspace."
msgstr "Ostanite usredotočeni uz radni prostor u tamnom načinu rada."

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:67
msgid "Work smoothly with fast and responsive tools."
msgstr "Radite glatko uz brze i responzivne alate."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:74
msgid "Add page support"
msgstr "Dodana podrška za stranice"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:75
msgid "Improve text element support (Spell Checking, Alignment, Bold, Italic etc.) (GSoc2026)"
msgstr "Poboljšana podrška za tekstne elemente (provjera pravopisa, poravnanje, podebljano, kurziv itd.) (GSoc2026)"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:76
msgid "Allow to lock items"
msgstr "Omogućeno zaključavanje stavki"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:77
msgid "Allow to draw rounded rectangle"
msgstr "Omogućeno crtanje zaobljenog pravokutnika"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:78
msgid "Improve selected basic shape (bug 519895)"
msgstr "Poboljšan odabir osnovnog oblika (pogreška 519895)"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:79
msgid "Allow to export selected elements as image"
msgstr "Omogućen izvoz odabranih elemenata kao slike"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:80
msgid "Add What's new Dialog"
msgstr "Dodan dijaloški okvir „Što je novo”"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:85
msgid "This update delivers a smoother, more customizable freehand drawing experience and fixes an issue where newly drawn lines flickered."
msgstr "Ovo ažuriranje omogućuje glađe i prilagodljivije crtanje rukom te ispravlja problem zbog kojeg su novonacrtane crte treperile."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:87
msgid "Drawing by hand feels much better and more natural now."
msgstr "Crtanje rukom sada je mnogo ugodnije i prirodnije."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:90
msgid "Added settings so you can change pen pressure and how smooth your lines look."
msgstr "Dodane su postavke za prilagodbu pritiska olovke i glatkoće crta."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:93
msgid "Lines and shapes will no longer blink or flash right after you draw them."
msgstr "Crte i oblici više neće treperiti odmah nakon što ih nacrtate."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:101
msgid "This is a small patch that improves the icons, updates the appstream metadata to include the correct information, and includes some bug fixes."
msgstr "Ova manja zakrpa poboljšava ikone, ažurira metapodatke AppStreama ispravnim informacijama i donosi nekoliko ispravaka pogrešaka."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.drawy.metainfo.xml:106
msgid "After months of work, Drawy has finally released! Drawy lets you create ideas, diagrams, and visual notes on an infinite whiteboard with a smooth and responsive canvas. You can draw with pressure-sensitive tablet support, add text, insert images, and use basic shapes such as rectangles, ellipses, arrows, and lines to organise your content clearly. You can choose your own color palette and export your work as image files whenever needed. Drawy is built to stay lightweight and fast, making it easy to capture ideas and work freely without distractions."
msgstr "Nakon višemjesečnog rada, Drawy je napokon objavljen! Drawy vam omogućuje stvaranje ideja, dijagrama i vizualnih bilježaka na neograničenoj bijeloj ploči s glatkom i responzivnom površinom za crtanje. Možete crtati uz podršku za tablet osjetljiv na pritisak, dodavati tekst i slike te koristiti osnovne oblike poput pravokutnika, elipsa, strelica i crta kako biste jasno organizirali sadržaj. Možete odabrati vlastitu paletu boja i izvesti svoj rad kao slikovne datoteke kad god zatreba. Drawy je osmišljen kao lagana i brza aplikacija koja olakšava bilježenje ideja i slobodan rad bez ometanja."
